From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fenrir <fenrir@invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:48:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Drop the seated/standing offset when the runtime recenters
 LOCAL/STAGE

xrizer builds OpenVR Seated as LOCAL plus the head pose captured on
ResetSeatedZeroPose. A runtime recenter (Quest: hold Meta) moves LOCAL and
signals XrEventDataReferenceSpaceChangePending; the stale offset then applied
that recenter a second time. On the event, recreate the adjusted space with
no offset so Seated follows the runtime's recentered LOCAL (XERK-2847).
---
 fakexr/src/lib.rs  |  34 ++++++++++--
 src/openxr_data.rs | 127 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

